#: sumup-payment-gateway-for-woocommerce.php:288
msgid "Use a publicly reachable HTTPS domain before connecting SumUp. If you are testing locally, use a tunnel such as ngrok or Cloudflare Tunnel and update WordPress Home and Site URL first."
msgstr "Използвайте публично достъпен HTTPS домейн, преди да свържете SumUp. Ако тествате локално, използвайте тунел като ngrok или Cloudflare Tunnel и първо актуализирайте WordPress Home и Site URL."

#: includes/class-wc-sumup-connection-diagnostics.php:92
msgid "Verified"
